      "Synchronous cache interruption aborts a captured session even when source authority is restored before React observes it.",
      "Failed/invalidated/fetching data do not authorize the combined form or preference entry; draft concealment and actor/client/owner keying are present.",
      "Core compares actual complete normalized response fields without invented identity/version echoes.",
      "Unknown session state survives closure and remains fenced through explicit read-only reload, with no automatic replay."
